sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as DiaryView / Settings
    participant M as main.ts (IPC)
    participant S as DiaryStore (diary.json)
    participant Sch as diarySchedule.ts
    participant P as proactive.ts (diary ctx)
    participant G as Gate (diary.ts)
    participant AI as queueManager / ai.ts
    participant N as showNotifyCard

    %% ===== 1. 保存日记 → 排程 =====
    UI->>M: diary:update(allowAi, visibleRoleIds, ...)
    M->>S: updateDiary(entry)  %% applyRevoke 整串撤销
    M->>Sch: onDiarySaved(entry)
    Sch->>Sch: 按 roleId 查 diaryCommentSchedules
    alt 角色无配置（兼容 v3.0.23）
        Sch->>M: generateDiaryComments(id, [legacyRoles], force=false)
    else 有配置 enabled=true / mode=normal
        Sch->>Sch: planNormal → window/delay/fixed → dueAt
        Sch->>S: upsertTask(pending, dueAt, fingerprint)
    else 有配置 enabled=true / mode=nhpp
        Sch->>P: rescheduleDiaryComment(diaryId, roleId)
        P->>P: sampleCandidate(diaryCtx, diary:id:role, now)
    else enabled=false
        Sch->>S: noop
    end
    M->>AI: summarizeDiary (unchanged)

    %% ===== 2. 到期调度 → 生成留言 → 通知 =====
    loop 每 60s（错峰 +15s）heartbeat
        Sch->>S: listTasks(pending, dueAt<=now)
        loop 每个到期任务（每轮最多 1 发送）
            Sch->>G: canRoleAccessDiary + selfRoleId 匹配 + commentLocked
            alt 锁定 / 不可见 / tone=skip
                Sch->>S: task=skipped(reason)
            else 通过
                Sch->>AI: generateDiaryComments(diaryId,[roleId],force=false)
                AI-->>Sch: text
                Sch->>S: addComment(scheduleKind) + task=sent
                Sch->>N: notifyDiaryEvent(comment, title, roleName, text)
            end
        end
        Sch->>P: heartbeatDiaryComments()
        P->>P: evaluateFeedback → inDnd → 新鲜度 → dailyLimit → 锁
        P->>Sch: sendDiaryComment(diaryId, roleId)  [deps 注入]
        Sch->>AI: generateDiaryComments(...,force=false)
        Sch->>S: addComment(scheduleKind=nhpp) + recordDiarySent
        Sch->>N: notifyDiaryEvent(...)
    end

    %% ===== 3. 用户回复 → AI 回复（事件驱动，不入排程）=====
    UI->>M: diary:replyAdd(diaryId, commentId, text)
    M->>G: 校验留言未 revoked / roleId 可见 / selfRoleId 匹配
    M->>S: addReply(user) + setAwaiting(false)
    M-->>UI: 立即返回（user reply 已落盘）
    M->>M: generateAiReply(diaryId, commentId)
    M->>G: buildDiaryContextBlock(roleId, selfRoleId)  %% P3 门控产物
    M->>M: buildContext = P0 用户原文 + P1 全历史 + P4 最近N + P5 关键词补4
    M->>AI: enqueueAndWait → queryAI(system=人设, user=context)
    alt 生成成功
        AI-->>M: aiText
        M->>S: addReply(ai) + setAwaiting(true)
        M->>N: notifyDiaryEvent(reply, title, roleName, aiText)
        N-->>UI: diary:changed(kind=comments) → 刷新对话串
    else 失败
        AI-->>M: error
        M->>S: setAwaiting(true)（允许重试）
        M-->>UI: error 轻提示 + logError
    end

    %% ===== 4. 静默分支（通知内部）=====
    N->>N: if silent===true → return（0 卡片 0 音）
    N->>N: else → 去重 sig → 入队 → show / sound
